                    "value": "Prime contract: A = the current Procore prime contract; B and C = Sage AR received and still owed; D = days the oldest unpaid invoice has been out; E = invoices not fully paid; F = A - B - C. Trades & vendors: H = every approved Procore commitment (the latest requisition's contract sum where there is one, as it includes the approved change orders); I, J = Sage AP paid and still owed; K, L = oldest unpaid days and invoices open; M = H - I - J.",
